                "title": "Blue Ridge Handleset, Fusion U2",
                "description": "Fusion U2, Blue Ridge Handleset - The Blue Ridge Handleset has a rustic look that will make it a great addition to any traditional home. As part of the American Relic Collection, it recalls historic designs in a way that is in step with contemporary design aesthetics. The Blue Ridge Handleset with Covered Deadbolt is available in antique pewter, medium bronze, or dark bronze finishes, all of which have a slightly textured surface. This entranceset is available as a dummy function or a single cylinder function and will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
